OL,3,GNEWSACan Royal Assent mean Guernsey
OL,4,Arevisits assisted dying laws?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second Crown dependency receiving
OL,7,FRoyal Assent for an assisted dying law
OL,8,Fcould make it easier for other places
OL,9,Fto enact their own legislation, a
OL,10,Fsenior politician in Guernsey says.
OL,12,FA law to allow terminally ill adults
OL,13,Fthe right to choose to end their own
OL,14,Flives was given Royal Assent in Jersey
OL,15,Fby King Charles III earlier this year.
OL,17,FThe Assisted Dying (Jersey) Law 2026
OL,18,Fwill come into force when it is
OL,19,Fregistered at Jersey's Royal Court,
OL,20,Falthough it will not come into effect
OL,21,Funtil next year.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
