OL,3,GNEWSACan Royal Assent mean Guernsey
OL,4,Arevisits assisted dying laws?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurrently assisted dying in Guernsey is
OL,7,Fstill illegal but advocates think 2027
OL,8,Fmight be the year to try again.
